;\\not\\Rightarrow\\;\n\\exists x\\,(C(x)\\land\\neg G(x)).\n\\]\nFor example, let the good things be \\(\\{a,b\\}\\) and the cheap things be \\(\\{b\\}\\). Some good thing is not cheap, yet every cheap thing is good.\n\n- **A** makes the same invalid reversal: some Hunan people do not like pepper does not imply that some pepper-likers are non-Hunan.\n- **B is valid:** “Some people are not selfish” is exactly equivalent to “Not all people are selfish.”\n- **C** makes the same invalid reversal: a good motive can have a bad effect without any good effect coming from a bad motive.\n- **D** makes the same invalid reversal: some southerners are non-Cantonese even if every Cantonese person is southern.\n\nThus **B is the only option that differs from the original reasoning**. The wording is ambiguous: if it literally asks which options are logically invalid, those are A, C, and D.\n\nFinal answer: **B** if asking for the nonmatching inference; **A, C, and D** if “not valid” is meant literally."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":205,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":728,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":451},"total_tokens":933},"user":null,"metadata":{}}
